WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.599
Recorded results on current v4 localnet. No transaction is signed in this recording.

2
00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:17.587
Coupon 1: the original record date fixes who receives each payment.

3
00:00:17.587 --> 00:00:25.804
10 recorded bonds × 50 = 500. The receipt matches this holder and exact amount.

4
00:00:25.804 --> 00:00:34.259
Recorded rights remain 10 / 5 / 3. A later holder has no old entitlement.

5
00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:48.897
The next record captures the transfer: 10 / 4 / 3 / 1. Earlier rights stay fixed.

6
00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:58.558
Bondholder voting: 13 for, 5 against. One ballot per holder; fixed snapshot weights.

7
00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:06.558
Maturity redemption: 18,000 principal paid across the recorded holders.

8
00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:15.227
The primary holder received 10,000. Its exact payment matches the retained receipt.

9
00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:24.296
Recorded principal transactions retain their real signatures and confirmation scope.

10
00:01:24.296 --> 00:01:31.658
18 bonds retired. Historical coupon rights survive principal burn.

11
00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:38.200
Test assets only. Human-wallet signing, public deployment and final submission are separate checks.
